Maintainer: Libre VMM Contributors <noreply@github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, libvirt-dev, pkg-config, libgtk-3-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/LucentOpenSoftware/libre-vmm
